WEBVTT

00:02.090 --> 00:04.710
<b>Wow, it's so pretty.</b>

00:04.840 --> 00:07.420
<b>Yeah, I want to come back
during the day.</b>

00:07.550 --> 00:10.050
<b>Right? Ugh...</b>

00:10.260 --> 00:11.260
<b>What's wrong?</b>

00:11.390 --> 00:13.680
<b>I've still got sand in my shoes.</b>

00:15.970 --> 00:17.270
<b>Miyako-san?</b>

00:17.890 --> 00:20.310
<b>I want to use it
as a reference for my manga.</b>

00:20.520 --> 00:24.480
<b>I don't really come to places
like this on my own, so...</b>

00:24.900 --> 00:26.780
<b>Let's take a picture!</b>

00:27.440 --> 00:30.450
<b>Okay, say cheese!</b>

00:31.990 --> 00:33.870
<b>That came out really nice.</b>

00:33.990 --> 00:37.500
<b>- It's freezing.
- Let's go before we catch a cold.</b>

00:38.580 --> 00:40.000
<b>Ricchan, are you hungry?</b>

00:40.210 --> 00:42.380
<b>I haven't eaten at all today.</b>

00:42.580 --> 00:44.460
<b>But you were eating meat...</b>

00:44.590 --> 00:47.710
<b>That was just a snack.
I need more energy.</b>

00:47.840 --> 00:50.430
<b>Oh no! You need to eat something now!</b>

00:50.550 --> 00:53.260
<b>There was a ramen place
near the station.</b>

00:53.390 --> 00:54.720
<b>What kind was it?</b>

00:54.850 --> 00:56.640
<b>Uh, I'm not sure.</b>

00:56.770 --> 00:58.140
<b>But I think it was...</b>

00:58.270 --> 01:00.850
<b>a marriage of rich and light flavors.</b>

01:01.060 --> 01:02.480
<b>Catch you guys later!</b>

01:02.600 --> 01:05.270
<b>- Ricchan's gone!
- She's out of control!</b>

01:05.400 --> 01:06.530
<b>What do we do?</b>

01:06.650 --> 01:09.530
<b>Once she gets like that,
she's unstoppable.</b>

01:10.780 --> 01:12.280
<b>- Let's go!
- Wait.</b>

01:12.780 --> 01:14.030
<b>Yay!</b>

01:15.740 --> 01:17.660
<b>Hey, let go.</b>

01:18.000 --> 01:22.210
<b>I'm not letting you go, Yuno-chan!</b>

01:31.880 --> 01:35.390
<b>You guys are too slow.
First one there pays the ramen!</b>

01:35.510 --> 01:36.890
<b>Uh, the "first one"?</b>

01:37.010 --> 01:39.600
<b>Ramen!</b>

01:39.730 --> 01:43.770
<b>I want a receipt...
for research expenses...</b>

01:46.770 --> 01:47.900
<b>Wait for me!</b>

02:03.040 --> 02:07.500
<b><i>Ready set and find out ready set and find out
it's only one newtype</i></b>

02:08.710 --> 02:13.340
<b><i>The story always revolves around us</i></b>

02:13.470 --> 02:17.890
<b><i>That may be a given But let me repeat it</i></b>

02:18.390 --> 02:23.310
<b><i>Can you read the guidelines?
No matter how carefully we write them</i></b>

02:23.560 --> 02:28.360
<b><i>Why does something always get in the way?
Still, we'll make it roar!</i></b>

02:28.610 --> 02:32.400
<b><i>In a heartbeat, like an overdrive</i></b>

02:32.530 --> 02:39.080
<b><i>We yearn to distort the world we see</i></b>

02:39.240 --> 02:43.960
<b><i>Seeing too clearly makes innocence
seem ridiculous, what a joke!</i></b>

02:44.120 --> 02:48.920
<b><i>Even vain attempts at being brave
Will be rewarded when the time comes</i></b>

02:49.090 --> 02:52.760
<b><i>This is the plot of our survival</i></b>

02:53.130 --> 02:58.470
<b><i>Rewriting the tale
Shedding absurd tears, the newtype way</i></b>

02:58.600 --> 03:03.060
<b><i>We can go anywhere, we can, so don't stop now</i></b>

03:03.480 --> 03:07.770
<b><i>Not an anime, not real either,
let's make our own category</i></b>

03:07.900 --> 03:11.070
<b><i>We've grown tired
of this complicated, dull world!</i></b>

03:11.190 --> 03:14.490
<b><i>Leave it to us, we'll write our own dreams</i></b>

03:14.650 --> 03:17.780
<b><i>Ready set and find out ready set and find out
it's only one newtype, our choice</i></b>

03:17.910 --> 03:19.320
<b><i>Following the steady beat</i></b>

03:19.660 --> 03:24.370
<b><i>Ready set and find out ready set and find out
it's only one newtype</i></b>

03:29.380 --> 03:31.290
<b>Ugh...</b>

03:34.550 --> 03:36.340
<b>Ouch!</b>

03:38.930 --> 03:40.430
<b>All right, then.</b>

03:42.810 --> 03:43.890
<b>How to ask someone out?</b>

03:44.020 --> 03:46.230
<b>"Hello. It's been a while."</b>

03:46.350 --> 03:49.270
<b>"This is Sengoku.
We used to be in a band together."</b>

03:49.400 --> 03:52.360
<b>"There is something
I would like to discuss."</b>

03:52.820 --> 03:55.900
<b>That's too formal.
Give me something more casual.</b>

03:57.240 --> 04:00.490
<b>"Hello. It's been a while.
How have you been?"</b>

04:00.620 --> 04:03.120
<b>"I'd like to discuss a certain matter."</b>

04:04.040 --> 04:07.790
<b>Do I need all of this?
No one sends an email for no reason.</b>

04:07.910 --> 04:10.330
<b>Is the "certain matter" necessary?</b>

04:21.600 --> 04:23.390
<b>Can we meet?</b>

04:29.440 --> 04:30.900
<b>Okay!</b>

04:29.810 --> 04:30.900
<b>That was fast.</b>

04:31.400 --> 04:34.650
<b>I feel so silly
for fretting over it so much.</b>

04:35.030 --> 04:38.650
<b>When?</b>

04:35.900 --> 04:38.650
<b>Nothing's changed at all since then.</b>

04:39.570 --> 04:43.240
<b>I wonder why we split up back then.</b>

04:57.670 --> 05:00.970
<b>There's still some time left.</b>

05:02.010 --> 05:05.430
<b>But if she doesn't show up...</b>

05:06.680 --> 05:08.270
<b>Hi, I'm here!</b>

05:09.390 --> 05:11.390
<b>Long time no see.</b>

05:11.730 --> 05:15.190
<b>I figured you'd be 15 minutes early,
so I came 20 minutes early.</b>

05:15.320 --> 05:17.400
<b>I didn't think you'd already be here.</b>

05:18.110 --> 05:21.150
<b>I was just done with my work,
that's all.</b>

05:22.240 --> 05:25.030
<b>I can't tell her I came an hour early.</b>

05:31.670 --> 05:35.040
<b>Nothing wakes up
my sleepy brain like soda!</b>

05:38.760 --> 05:41.800
<b>Yuno, you really did
make your dream come true.</b>

05:42.880 --> 05:44.090
<b>My dream?</b>

05:44.220 --> 05:47.850
<b>You said you wanted
to make a living from music.</b>

05:49.270 --> 05:50.730
<b>Don't you remember?</b>

05:51.020 --> 05:54.060
<b>I don't remember anything
from the past.</b>

05:54.480 --> 05:57.440
<b>You used to say it
every day in middle school.</b>

05:57.570 --> 06:00.190
<b>"We're the best band ever, aren't we?"</b>

06:00.320 --> 06:01.530
<b>"I know we'll sell well..."</b>

06:01.650 --> 06:04.570
<b>- "We can even go global!"
- Stop!</b>

06:06.950 --> 06:09.700
<b>That part of you hasn't changed at all.</b>

06:12.160 --> 06:13.120
<b>I've changed.</b>

06:13.920 --> 06:15.750
<b>It's been two years.</b>

06:16.130 --> 06:19.300
<b>To me, you haven't changed at all.</b>

06:19.420 --> 06:22.090
<b>As always, you're still everyone's goal.</b>

06:22.220 --> 06:23.510
<b>What do you mean?</b>

06:25.430 --> 06:26.970
<b>The lyrics for the collab.</b>

06:27.100 --> 06:30.810
<b>I wrote them based
on our true feelings back then.</b>

06:32.180 --> 06:34.980
<b>We push each other forward
with our dreams</b>

06:35.100 --> 06:37.560
<b>and move toward them together.</b>

06:38.690 --> 06:40.230
<b>It's our song.</b>

06:42.360 --> 06:44.950
<b>Recording...</b>

06:45.410 --> 06:46.570
<b>What are you doing?</b>

06:46.700 --> 06:48.410
<b>It's the sound of summer.</b>

06:48.530 --> 06:50.410
<b>I might use it in the song.</b>

06:50.620 --> 06:52.120
<b>Really?</b>

06:52.250 --> 06:53.200
<b>Sounds fun.</b>

06:53.330 --> 06:54.910
<b>How about this?</b>

06:56.920 --> 06:59.000
<b>It sounds like a construction site.</b>

07:01.000 --> 07:02.800
<b>- Cicadas, maybe?
- Ah, nice.</b>

07:02.920 --> 07:03.800
<b>What about the AC?</b>

07:03.920 --> 07:09.890
<b>Those were our bright,
joyful, and unforgettable days.</b>

07:11.220 --> 07:13.060
<b>I promise we won't be loud!</b>

07:13.180 --> 07:16.190
<b>That's not the issue.
You need to apply for...</b>

07:16.480 --> 07:19.270
<b>We'll just mime everything, see?</b>

07:19.400 --> 07:22.150
<b>Yes! Ba-dum-dum, boom!</b>

07:23.070 --> 07:24.190
<b>As I said...</b>

07:24.320 --> 07:27.030
<b>We're making music.</b>

07:27.570 --> 07:30.990
<b>We've decided to make a living
as musicians.</b>

07:33.040 --> 07:35.120
<b>We want to live off music.</b>

07:35.290 --> 07:40.380
<b>Library prep room
and authorized supremacy band practice</b>

07:36.250 --> 07:40.380
<b>We all found our dreams
in each other's dreams.</b>

07:45.590 --> 07:50.140
<b><i>Was I searching for a shortcut
to tomorrow?</i></b>

07:48.970 --> 07:52.510
<b>If you can do it,
maybe we can do it too.</b>

07:50.260 --> 07:55.520
<b><i>Look down, and I feel like I'll vanish</i></b>

07:55.680 --> 08:00.230
<b><i>Rusting noise, pierced scars</i></b>

08:00.360 --> 08:05.570
<b><i>Like it or not, there's no turning back</i></b>

08:04.690 --> 08:05.860
<b>Sorry I'm late.</b>

08:06.030 --> 08:07.780
<b>Congratulations!</b>

08:06.030 --> 08:10.740
<b><i>Still lost in an endless blur
I want to believe we can find it</i></b>

08:08.240 --> 08:09.780
<b>A songwriting request?</b>

08:09.910 --> 08:12.240
<b>You could already live off music.</b>

08:10.870 --> 08:15.870
<b><i>No proof, no reason
Even if it's reckless</i></b>

08:12.370 --> 08:14.790
<b>Dreams really do come true, huh?</b>

08:15.330 --> 08:17.080
<b>We're doing it, aren't we?</b>

08:16.000 --> 08:20.920
<b><i>Our echoes keep linking us together
Past the edge of our dreams</i></b>

08:18.290 --> 08:20.130
<b>The dream we've achieved.</b>

08:20.580 --> 08:24.050
<b>It isn't just this.
It'll keep growing forever.</b>

08:21.040 --> 08:25.710
<b><i>Reach out and take hold of the future</i></b>

08:25.840 --> 08:30.840
<b><i>Scream it out, wherever you are
We're here, right now</i></b>

08:28.170 --> 08:30.800
<b>With you leading the way, Yuno,</b>

08:30.970 --> 08:36.060
<b><i>Strong enough to erase
this overflowing loneliness</i></b>

08:31.300 --> 08:33.760
<b>I felt like I could dream forever.</b>

08:35.010 --> 08:36.060
<b>I have to bounce!</b>

08:36.220 --> 08:40.980
<b><i>These frayed ends of hair
are a rebel's signal fire</i></b>

08:36.350 --> 08:38.440
<b>- She ran away!
- Yuno!</b>

08:38.560 --> 08:40.440
<b>Wait!</b>

08:41.100 --> 08:44.270
<b><i>Take it in, take it in</i></b>

08:41.980 --> 08:43.570
<b>I wanted to chase you</b>

08:44.400 --> 08:48.150
<b><i>And fight back</i></b>

08:44.650 --> 08:47.650
<b>and someday run alongside you.</b>

08:56.160 --> 08:59.160
<b>I used to think dreams
were just dreams,</b>

08:59.370 --> 09:03.630
<b>but I thought maybe taking action
could make them real.</b>

09:04.840 --> 09:08.420
<b>So Kaede's studying hard
to become a vet,</b>

09:08.550 --> 09:11.970
<b>and Yuina's working out
to go to space.</b>

09:13.050 --> 09:14.300
<b>Why now?</b>

09:14.430 --> 09:17.890
<b>We just didn't tell you.
We thought it was unrealistic.</b>

09:18.020 --> 09:22.730
<b>But watching you made us feel like
it wasn't completely impossible.</b>

09:23.770 --> 09:25.270
<b>I didn't know that.</b>

09:25.770 --> 09:29.490
<b>I was grateful for the push
you gave me when we broke up.</b>

09:30.280 --> 09:32.360
<b>I wasn't trying to...</b>

09:33.160 --> 09:36.280
<b>So they didn't actually abandon me.</b>

09:36.410 --> 09:38.370
<b>Believing in each other's dream</b>

09:38.790 --> 09:41.000
<b>can push you toward your own.</b>

09:41.120 --> 09:42.330
<b>Isn't that awesome?</b>

09:43.330 --> 09:44.670
<b>I thought...</b>

09:45.000 --> 09:50.090
<b>everyone was happily moving forward,
and only I was being left behind.</b>

09:51.470 --> 09:52.930
<b>Those lyrics...</b>

09:54.090 --> 09:55.760
<b>They were about me too.</b>

09:58.010 --> 10:01.180
<b>Work's hard for me too,</b>

10:01.680 --> 10:05.360
<b>but seeing you succeed
makes me want to work harder.</b>

10:05.480 --> 10:09.820
<b>And because of that, my dream
of making music with you came true.</b>

10:10.690 --> 10:12.030
<b>So thanks.</b>

10:13.030 --> 10:14.410
<b>Me too...</b>

10:15.620 --> 10:16.620
<b>It's nothing.</b>

10:16.870 --> 10:19.330
<b>Yes, it is. Your whole face is red.</b>

10:19.450 --> 10:21.450
<b>- Stop it.
- Did it make you cringe?</b>

10:21.580 --> 10:22.750
<b>No.</b>

10:23.040 --> 10:25.540
<b>But I'm glad we talked about it.</b>

10:25.670 --> 10:27.710
<b>I needed it for the song.</b>

10:27.840 --> 10:32.050
<b>Wait, you called me for work?
Not because you wanted to see me?</b>

10:32.170 --> 10:33.220
<b>It was for work.</b>

10:33.340 --> 10:34.760
<b>No way!</b>

10:34.880 --> 10:38.890
<b>I was so excited that I flipped
my sleep schedule to see you.</b>

10:39.010 --> 10:40.930
<b>But we met in the evening.</b>

10:41.060 --> 10:43.810
<b>I usually wake up at 9 p.m.</b>

10:43.940 --> 10:46.350
<b>Sorry that I woke you up,
but I have to go.</b>

10:46.480 --> 10:48.570
<b>- Already?
- I've got a deadline.</b>

10:52.240 --> 10:54.070
<b>- See you.
- Bye.</b>

10:58.450 --> 10:59.950
<b>Yuno!</b>

11:00.700 --> 11:02.910
<b>Let's work together again!</b>

11:03.250 --> 11:05.500
<b>Can I email your agency?</b>

11:05.620 --> 11:09.130
<b>Shush! Just send me a message
on my private account.</b>

11:09.250 --> 11:10.630
<b>Okay!</b>

11:21.310 --> 11:26.270
<b>Breaking up isn't the end,
but the start of something new, huh?</b>

11:30.900 --> 11:33.820
<b>Oh, I think I've got something.</b>

11:48.710 --> 11:50.630
<b>It came out nicely.</b>

11:51.090 --> 11:53.840
<b>A present for Arale-chan.</b>

11:57.470 --> 12:00.640
<b>- Thanks for coming all this way.
- It's okay.</b>

12:01.010 --> 12:03.100
<b>I haven't been here in a while.</b>

12:03.220 --> 12:05.060
<b>Well, you did move away.</b>

12:05.180 --> 12:06.100
<b>Yeah.</b>

12:06.520 --> 12:08.690
<b>Here you go. Chupa-Satu Volume 1!</b>

12:07.230 --> 12:09.190
<b>Chupacabu Saturation by Yako Fujimi</b>

12:08.810 --> 12:10.230
<b>Thanks.</b>

12:10.480 --> 12:13.480
<b>Just checking,
but you already read it, right?</b>

12:13.610 --> 12:14.400
<b>Yeah.</b>

12:14.780 --> 12:16.990
<b>I wanted to read it with your notes.</b>

12:17.110 --> 12:20.700
<b>Well, it's nothing special.</b>

12:20.820 --> 12:23.490
<b>Chupa-Satu is super special!
It's amazing!</b>

12:23.620 --> 12:24.410
<b>Yeah.</b>

12:24.790 --> 12:30.080
<b>Your Magilulu reviews were so fun
to listen to back in elementary school.</b>

12:30.210 --> 12:32.000
<b>Watching Magilulu on Sundays</b>

12:32.130 --> 12:36.550
<b>and hearing you talk about it on Mondays
was my favorite routine.</b>

12:38.930 --> 12:40.300
<b>Raki
Incoming call</b>

12:39.130 --> 12:40.300
<b>It's Raki-chan.</b>

12:41.220 --> 12:42.010
<b>Hello?</b>

12:42.140 --> 12:43.470
<b>"This is really bad!"</b>

12:43.600 --> 12:44.390
<b>What happened?</b>

12:44.510 --> 12:49.520
<b>"There's a video going around
of you and Yako-sensei fighting."</b>

12:49.640 --> 12:53.440
<b>"We know you're close,
but it looks pretty bad."</b>

12:53.610 --> 12:59.820
<b>MewType internal conflict
Miyako Fuji vs Arale Nakamachi</b>

12:53.690 --> 12:56.610
<b>"You're way too intense!"</b>

12:56.730 --> 12:57.650
<b>"Don't you dare."</b>

12:57.780 --> 12:59.820
<b>- "Enough already!"
- "Wha..."</b>

13:00.070 --> 13:03.660
<b>"We're the ones who decided
to do the show."</b>

13:04.580 --> 13:08.540
<b>"I don't believe it,
but I thought you should know."</b>

13:08.660 --> 13:10.790
<b>Go it, thank you.</b>

13:11.250 --> 13:12.290
<b>It must be Viola.</b>

13:14.170 --> 13:16.550
<b>That's scary
Are they blaming each other?
At this point this has to be marketing</b>

13:15.630 --> 13:18.170
<b>I hope Miyako-san's okay.</b>

13:17.050 --> 13:18.170
<b>The angle lol
It's definitely staged
Playing the blame game!</b>

13:18.550 --> 13:21.510
<b>I've already told her
all I know about Viola.</b>

13:23.220 --> 13:25.220
<b>Are you okay?</b>

13:25.430 --> 13:29.020
<b>Miyako-san was just being manipulated
by Viola to say that.</b>

13:29.140 --> 13:32.270
<b>Yeah, I get it, so don't worry about me.</b>

13:34.440 --> 13:36.020
<b>I know how she must feel.</b>

13:36.610 --> 13:40.070
<b>Miyako-san trusted Viola
with all her heart.</b>

13:41.530 --> 13:42.320
<b>I'm sorry!</b>

13:43.200 --> 13:45.780
<b>I'm sorry, I...</b>

13:47.370 --> 13:48.830
<b>Yeah...</b>

13:50.370 --> 13:56.420
<b>Nonono... Nono-chan is here!</b>

13:56.540 --> 13:59.460
<b>We've got a bunch of comments!
Good evening!</b>

13:59.630 --> 14:03.720
<b>Hey, Nono-chan!
Nonoooo!
Nononono!
Nono!</b>

14:00.090 --> 14:03.720
<b>Yesterday, we all went to the beach!</b>

14:04.390 --> 14:07.600
<b>We had a bonfire at the beach!</b>

14:07.760 --> 14:11.060
<b>And then, and then...</b>

14:13.230 --> 14:16.480
<b>I became a grown-up.</b>

14:16.860 --> 14:20.360
<b>There were so many firsts for me... Huh?</b>

14:20.780 --> 14:25.320
<b>"I heard MewType is getting flamed.
Are you okay?"</b>

14:28.410 --> 14:30.620
<b>We're on fire!</b>

14:32.080 --> 14:33.120
<b>A scandal?</b>

14:33.830 --> 14:36.920
<b>"MewType members are falling apart."</b>

14:37.040 --> 14:42.130
<b>"Internal drama, nonstop scandals,
controversy marketing."</b>

14:42.260 --> 14:45.390
<b>"Is bad publicity
better than no publicity?"</b>

14:45.510 --> 14:48.220
<b>Whatever. I don't care.</b>

15:13.450 --> 15:15.960
<b>- Yes?
- "Yuno!"</b>

15:16.080 --> 15:19.630
<b>So loud...
Koharu? Did I give you my number?</b>

15:19.750 --> 15:21.090
<b>"Your manager-san did."</b>

15:21.210 --> 15:22.210
<b>How could she?</b>

15:22.340 --> 15:24.090
<b>"All I did was ask her!"</b>

15:24.220 --> 15:28.720
<b>"She told me you seemed depressed lately
and asked me to cheer you up."</b>

15:28.850 --> 15:31.810
<b>"Does she know
we used to be classmates?"</b>

15:31.930 --> 15:33.720
<b>Whatever. What's up?</b>

15:33.850 --> 15:36.190
<b>"I heard the demo! It's incredible!"</b>

15:36.350 --> 15:41.150
<b>True End of Dreams.wav</b>

15:36.520 --> 15:38.770
<b>I was just listening to it too.</b>

15:38.900 --> 15:41.150
<b>"Oh? Are you still working on it?"</b>

15:41.360 --> 15:43.990
<b>No, I was just listening
to how amazing it is.</b>

15:44.110 --> 15:45.070
<b>"What?"</b>

15:46.240 --> 15:47.700
<b>"You're hilarious!"</b>

15:47.860 --> 15:52.910
<b>Koharu
On Call</b>

15:48.110 --> 15:50.660
<b>"You don't sound depressed at all!"</b>

15:50.780 --> 15:52.910
<b>"That's all I wanted to say. Bye!"</b>

15:55.660 --> 15:57.420
<b>That's right.</b>

15:57.540 --> 16:01.590
<b>Even scandals don't reach you
if you're not in the same circle.</b>

16:02.460 --> 16:06.510
<b>"Cancelled festival,"
"Kandagawa," "Kan-chan,"</b>

16:06.630 --> 16:10.300
<b>"What day is it?" "Pre-orders begin,"</b>

16:10.430 --> 16:12.850
<b>"Post a good reaction meme."</b>

16:13.510 --> 16:15.980
<b>This is what's trending right now.</b>

16:17.350 --> 16:18.600
<b>But...</b>

16:18.810 --> 16:22.060
<b>MewType internal conflict
Miyako Fuji vs Arale Nakamachi</b>

16:19.560 --> 16:21.360
<b>I bet it bothers them.</b>

16:23.400 --> 16:24.320
<b>"Don't you dare!"</b>

16:24.440 --> 16:26.490
<b>- "Enough already!"
- "Wha..."</b>

16:26.740 --> 16:29.700
<b>"We're the ones who decided
to do the show."</b>

16:29.820 --> 16:30.910
<b>"Cut the act!"</b>

16:31.030 --> 16:34.450
<b>"You manipulate people
with your lies and tear them..."</b>

16:34.580 --> 16:38.370
<b>You're the only one
who could've made this video.</b>

16:34.580 --> 16:39.040
<b>Now, I have adults who will help me!</b>

16:39.170 --> 16:40.420
<b>Viola...</b>

16:39.170 --> 16:40.420
<b>Please, wait!</b>

16:45.630 --> 16:48.630
<b>Please deny it. Say it wasn't you!</b>

17:02.270 --> 17:04.400
<b>Don't pretend you didn't know.</b>

17:06.820 --> 17:10.740
<b>They all said those things
because they care about you.</b>

17:13.030 --> 17:14.490
<b>I knew that.</b>

17:15.330 --> 17:17.160
<b>But still,</b>

17:17.540 --> 17:20.460
<b>I didn't want to believe
it was all a lie.</b>

17:22.790 --> 17:24.250
<b>For the first time...</b>

17:24.500 --> 17:28.260
<b>I thought I'd finally met someone
who could understand me</b>

17:28.380 --> 17:30.760
<b>down to the depths of my heart...</b>

17:37.890 --> 17:41.440
<b>I just wanted to stay
with her a little longer.</b>

17:42.140 --> 17:45.190
<b>That was all.</b>

18:08.500 --> 18:10.970
<b>Shiroyama</b>

18:11.130 --> 18:14.890
<b>Yuno-san-chan's song
got instant approval from the client.</b>

18:15.010 --> 18:16.470
<b>- Yeah.
- Huh?</b>

18:16.850 --> 18:18.600
<b>It hasn't been announced,</b>

18:18.720 --> 18:22.140
<b>but the collaboration song credits
are already out.</b>

18:22.310 --> 18:23.350
<b>What do you mean?</b>

18:23.480 --> 18:28.190
<b>People are excited because Yuno-san's
former bandmate wrote the lyrics.</b>

18:28.570 --> 18:30.690
<b>So the song got leaked?</b>

18:30.820 --> 18:33.570
<b>No, just the songwriting credits.</b>

18:33.700 --> 18:36.620
<b>Old fans of Yuno-san's band
seem happy about it.</b>

18:37.280 --> 18:40.290
<b>Well, I'm glad if they're happy.</b>

18:40.410 --> 18:42.790
<b>Let's work hard on the recording</b>

18:43.000 --> 18:44.750
<b>so they'll enjoy the track.</b>

18:46.830 --> 18:47.630
<b>Yeah.</b>

18:47.920 --> 18:51.010
<b>- Let's do our best.
- All right!</b>

18:52.510 --> 18:56.680
<b>- Hey guys...
- Hey!</b>

18:57.050 --> 18:58.800
<b>Why is Yuno-san-chan here?</b>

18:58.930 --> 19:00.560
<b>You go to this school too?</b>

19:00.680 --> 19:03.890
<b>Yuno-chan had her
school screening today.</b>

19:04.020 --> 19:05.140
<b>It's schooling.</b>

19:05.440 --> 19:08.900
<b>I asked her to join us for lunch!</b>

19:09.900 --> 19:11.690
<b>Miyako-san...</b>

19:12.190 --> 19:13.860
<b>Well, uh...</b>

19:13.990 --> 19:15.150
<b>Are you all right?</b>

19:15.450 --> 19:16.700
<b>No, I'm not.</b>

19:16.820 --> 19:18.410
<b>Of course you're not.</b>

19:18.530 --> 19:22.040
<b>To be honest,
I can't think straight right now,</b>

19:22.160 --> 19:24.870
<b>but I know I need to make things right.</b>

19:25.000 --> 19:26.710
<b>Don't push yourself.</b>

19:26.830 --> 19:30.960
<b>Minetsuki-san,
thank you for the materials.</b>

19:31.090 --> 19:35.260
<b>It's embarrassing to admit,
but I've clearly come to understand</b>

19:36.010 --> 19:38.010
<b>that I was being used by Viola.</b>

19:38.470 --> 19:41.470
<b>I've said such awful things
to you, Arale.</b>

19:41.600 --> 19:44.350
<b>I know this isn't enough,
but let me say it...</b>

19:44.640 --> 19:47.440
<b>- I'm truly sorry.
- No, it's okay!</b>

19:47.560 --> 19:48.730
<b>Oh, right!</b>

19:49.150 --> 19:50.360
<b>Here.</b>

19:53.030 --> 19:55.110
<b>Magical Physical Kululu</b>

19:53.860 --> 19:55.110
<b>This is...</b>

19:55.440 --> 19:57.030
<b>I want you to have it!</b>

19:57.150 --> 19:59.910
<b>I wanted to give this to you sooner,</b>

20:00.030 --> 20:03.240
<b>but I knew you needed
some time to be left alone.</b>

20:03.620 --> 20:06.500
<b>So I've been keeping it...</b>

20:06.830 --> 20:11.380
<b>But, well, I can only do this much.</b>

20:11.500 --> 20:14.260
<b>I just want you to feel better.</b>

20:20.640 --> 20:22.260
<b>Thank you.</b>

20:24.140 --> 20:28.890
<b>There's no need to feel bad about it.
You were just taken advantage of.</b>

20:29.730 --> 20:31.980
<b>I knew you'd say that.</b>

20:32.110 --> 20:32.900
<b>What?</b>

20:33.110 --> 20:37.280
<b>Therefore, I will condemn myself.</b>

20:37.740 --> 20:39.070
<b>What do you mean?</b>

20:39.200 --> 20:40.530
<b>But why?</b>

20:40.870 --> 20:42.700
<b>It was my failure.</b>

20:42.910 --> 20:45.950
<b>I was a hollow person
with nothing inside.</b>

20:46.160 --> 20:49.710
<b>- What are you saying? That's not true!
- Miyako-chan.</b>

20:50.120 --> 20:51.500
<b>You scared me.</b>

20:53.380 --> 20:56.590
<b>I've thought about what I want to do.</b>

20:57.630 --> 21:00.800
<b>I want to help everyone's flowers bloom.</b>

21:01.550 --> 21:02.390
<b>I was...</b>

21:02.510 --> 21:05.970
<b>If the flowers wilt,
I'll give them a boost of energy,</b>

21:06.100 --> 21:09.190
<b>and if they feel down,
I'll give them a big hug.</b>

21:09.600 --> 21:11.810
<b>I want to make everyone's smiles bloom.</b>

21:12.100 --> 21:13.810
<b>I can't stop myself!</b>

21:14.110 --> 21:16.820
<b>This is what I want to do!</b>

21:22.320 --> 21:23.870
<b>Hug!</b>

21:26.790 --> 21:28.370
<b>You've got skills.</b>

21:28.700 --> 21:31.370
<b>I can see right through you.</b>

21:32.630 --> 21:33.750
<b>You seem pretty close.</b>

21:34.380 --> 21:37.250
<b>I'm going to live the way I want, too.</b>

21:39.220 --> 21:42.760
<b>But first,
I'll take care of what I have to do.</b>

21:43.050 --> 21:46.260
<b>Miyako-chan! Where are you going?</b>

21:46.390 --> 21:47.810
<b>I will redeem myself.</b>

21:48.680 --> 21:50.310
<b>I'll do an Akihabara marathon</b>

21:50.430 --> 21:54.900
<b>To Be Continued</b>

21:51.100 --> 21:53.020
<b>and a hundred shrine visits.</b>

21:55.980 --> 22:03.700
<b><i>Why can birds fly through the sky?
Why are cats always asleep?</i></b>

22:03.820 --> 22:07.620
<b><i>How will you live today?</i></b>

22:07.740 --> 22:15.630
<b><i>All, all, all of it
Let's go search for it all</i></b>

22:19.670 --> 22:27.350
<b><i>Why does the morning sun kiss my skin?
Why does the night leave me feeling down?</i></b>

22:27.470 --> 22:35.020
<b><i>If only we could split our sorrows in half
Wouldn't that be great?</i></b>

22:35.810 --> 22:43.110
<b><i>Laughter and worry interweave
In a corner of this vast world</i></b>

22:43.700 --> 22:51.410
<b><i>Come with us
To uncover the secrets of the universe</i></b>

22:53.040 --> 23:00.750
<b><i>What stories shall we share today?
What melodies shall we sing?</i></b>

23:00.880 --> 23:04.680
<b><i>Even flowers as yet unseen</i></b>

23:04.800 --> 23:11.850
<b><i>All, all, all of it
Let's go search for it all</i></b>

23:12.680 --> 23:19.610
<b><i>All, all, all of it
Let's go search for it all</i></b>

23:25.780 --> 23:27.070
<b>Oh no, we have to go!</b>

23:27.200 --> 23:29.120
<b>The teacher's going to be mad again.</b>

23:29.240 --> 23:30.830
<b>This'll make a good anecdote.</b>

23:30.950 --> 23:32.750
<b>An untold path to our debut?</b>

23:32.870 --> 23:33.660
<b>Air drums too.</b>

23:33.790 --> 23:36.000
<b>Guess we'll continue later.</b>

23:36.120 --> 23:37.830
<b>- Hurry up.
- Okay.</b>

23:37.960 --> 23:39.790
<b>All right, see you.</b>

23:38.420 --> 23:39.880
<b>Goodbye</b>
